               "secondary_keys": [],
               "content": "The first player is normally the player to the left of the dealer (you can also choose the youngest player) and gameplay usually follows a clockwise direction. If playing with two people in total, the person other than the dealer starts(or the youngest person). The game usually starts with seven cards.",
