                  "plus four",
                  "action",
                  "color",
                  "change",
                  "symbol",
                  "draw"
               ],
               "secondary_keys": [],
               "content": "The +2(aka draw two), +4(aka draw four), wild, and reverse cards are known as action cards. This is because they each perform an action when played. These cards do not have numbers, but symbols. +2 has the +2 symbol, skip has the skip symbol, so on and so forth.",
