            {
               "name": "Reverse",
               "keys": [
                  "reverse",
                  "direction",
                  "skip",
                  "clockwise",
                  "counter-clockwise",
                  "counterclockwise",
                  "counter clockwise"
               ],
               "secondary_keys": [],
               "content": "The reverse card is always one of the colors red, blue, green, or yellow. It is an action card. It reverses the game's direction if playing with more than two players, making it counter-clockwise if it is clockwise, and vice-versa. If playing with two players, the person who plays the reverse card plays again, and there is no direction change as there can be no direction with two people.",
