                  "draw four",
                  "plus four",
                  "+4",
                  "draw"
               ],
               "secondary_keys": [],
               "content": "The draw four(aka plus four) card is an action card and a wild card. It has no color, so it can be played no matter the color or number of the card on top of the discard pile. If someone plays a draw four card, they can change the color. It also makes the next player draw four cards, and skips their turn. If another player plays a draw four card on you, your turn is skipped and you have to draw four cards and they can change the color, and vice-versa.",
